        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Imperial Court sealed form called luck path supreme true inheritance is covered on Luck Path Supreme True Inheritance.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_luck_path_supreme_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit later states that Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s three true inheritances cover all of his luck path methods: self luck, all living being’s luck, and heaven and earth luck. Self luck is with Lang Ya; all living being’s luck was inside Imperial Court blessed land; heaven and earth luck is in Longevity Heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1051
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
