        "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land",
        "fac_longevity_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later proposes exchanging venerable true inheritances of equal value for Longevity Heaven’s luck path true inheritance of Giant Sun.",
